<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title><%= title %> | Garment Pattern Store</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/customer-experience.css"><%- include('partials/theme') %></head><body><%- include('partials/header') %><main class="fashion-page"><span class="eyebrow">Customer support</span><h1 class="page-title">Let’s talk patterns.</h1><p class="page-intro">Questions about a pattern, available file selection or an order can be directed through the store’s configured support channel.</p><section class="contact-layout" style="margin-top:30px"><aside class="contact-aside"><span class="eyebrow" style="color:#e2af88"><%= siteSettings.store_name %></span><h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:32px;margin:12px 0">Support for your pattern workflow.</h2><p>Review the live collection and product options first. Contact us using the details below.</p><% if(siteSettings.support_cta){ %><p><%= siteSettings.support_cta %></p><% } %><div class="contact-detail"><b>Pattern enquiries</b><br><% if(siteSettings.contact_email){ %><a href="mailto:<%= siteSettings.contact_email %>"><%= siteSettings.contact_email %></a><br><% } %><% if(siteSettings.contact_phone){ %><a href="tel:<%= siteSettings.contact_phone.replace(/[^+\d]/g,'') %>"><%= siteSettings.contact_phone %></a><br><% } %><% if(siteSettings.whatsapp_number){ %><a href="https://wa.me/<%= siteSettings.whatsapp_number.replace(/\D/g,'') %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp</a><br><% } %><% if(siteSettings.address){ %><span><%= siteSettings.address %></span><% } %><% if(!siteSettings.contact_email && !siteSettings.contact_phone && !siteSettings.whatsapp_number){ %>Please use the contact channel on our main website.<% } %></div><div class="contact-detail"><b>Existing selections</b><br>Review your current shopping cart.</div></aside><div class="form-surface"><span class="eyebrow">Quick access</span><h2 style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:30px;margin:10px 0">How can we help?</h2><p class="page-intro">Browse our patterns or review your cart. For order questions, please include your order reference.</p><% if(canVisit('/products')){ %><a class="fashion-button" href="/products" style="margin-top:20px"><%= siteSettings.view_products_label %></a><% } %><% if(canVisit('/cart')){ %><a class="text-link" href="/cart" style="margin-left:18px">View Cart →</a><% } %></div></section></main><%- include('partials/footer') %><script src="/js/main.js"></script></body></html>
